+# Password hashing
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use argon2id as the password hashing algorithm. This was stated by the user in a session and is recorded as an unconfirmed statement rather than a formally ratified decision. No parameters (memory cost, iterations, parallelism, salt length) are recorded, so none are specified here.
